    "text": "<p>We have been given</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that the domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mrow></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced></math>, here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup></math>&nbsp;is very small positive quantity,</p><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Range&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is domain of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>135</mn><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>135</mn></math></p><p>Note: This question was bonus in Jee Main April 2023 session.</p>",
